    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On March 12, 2024, in Mathare, a community gathering took on a critical topic, dementia. Misunderstood by many in Kenya, the condition is often seen as a curse or simply an unavoidable part of aging. This discussion aimed to challenge these misconceptions and bring clarity to a subject long shrouded in stigma.",
